# ======================================================================
# fragile-decomp .gitignore
#
# RULES (see AGENTS.md):
#   1. Never commit any original game file.
#   2. Never commit any decompiled/disassembled output.
#   3. Everything derived from the game lives under build/; original media
#      lives only under iso/.
#
# This file structurally enforces rules 1 and 2.
# ======================================================================

# --- Rule 1: original game media / extracted game content -------------
# iso/ holds the reference ISO (and anything else original that must
# never be committed). Mined for analysis only.
/iso/
/build/

# Common disc-image containers (in case a stray copy exists anywhere)
*.iso
*.bin
*.cue
*.nrg
*.img
*.mdf
*.mds
*.rar

# --- Rule 2: decompilation / disassembly outputs ----------------------
/build/
*.ghidra/
ghidra.rep/
*.gpr
*.gzf

# Decompiler outputs that might be generated outside build/
decompiled/
reconstructed/
reimpl/

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# --- OS / editor -------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
/Fragile Allegiance
/ghidra_12.1.2_PUBLIC
